==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has reached a massive 120 Million Downloads worldwide! In thanks to all of our players, we've got special events available for a limited time!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from October 5th (11:00am) until October 29th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Earn Cat Food from the Download Celebration Scratcher!'''}}<br>
A total of three Scratcher cards, with one available every Monday!<br>
Just tap one of the three circles and wait for your prize to be revealed!

Make one scratch during each time period listed below!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #1: October 5th (11:00 AM) until October 11th (11:59 PM)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #2: October 12th (11:00 AM) until October 18th (11:59 PM)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #3: October 19th (11:00 AM) until October 29th (10:59 AM)'''}}<br>
Be sure to claim all three chances for a maximum possible total of {{Color|#4A86E8|'''450 Cat Food'''}} in prizes!<br>
Try your luck and get that sweet, sweet Cat Food!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited DL Celebration Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Use Legendary Starshines to access the special Event Capsules!<br>
Featuring a rush of limited units and Featured Items!<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Featured Item(s): Platinum Shard, Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Reward(s): 3 Limited Units, XP, Battle Items'''}}<br>
Collect all 10 Platinum Shard to get a {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Platinum Ticket'''}} and guarantee an Uber Rare unit!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> The Event Capsules can only be used with Event Tickets earned in-game.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Event Capsules will be unavailable after the event ends and Event Tickets will be unusable.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Extra Event Tickets cannot be converted into items or XP.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Featured items will no longer appear in the Capsules once they have all been collected.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Missions and Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Up to twenty-four 120M DL Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Rewards: 5 Rare Tickets, 5 Cat Tickets, Battle Items, Legendary Starshine<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''120M DL Celebration Missions'''}}<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Legendary Starshine<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Limited-time Special Missions will only be available until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the Missions disappear at the end of the event!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Download Celebration Stages on now!'''}}<br>
Earn Cat Tickets, XP, and items by clearing the Download Celebration Stages! Visit the Legend Stages from the title screen to access these limited-time stages!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・120M Celebration Gifts Galore! on now!'''}}<br>
When The Battle Cats hits 120 Million Downloads, that means one thing - time to party with a spectacular festival!
Reward(s): {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Legendary Starshine'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Using a Catamin A will immediately grant you another stage attempt.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Map: "Fireworks Spectacular"'''}}<br>
The Fireworks Gang gets ready to blast off in a tough new map!<br>
Reward(s): Catseye (Legend, Dark), Rare Ticket, etc.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> This stage can be challenged at User Rank 1600 or higher.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering'''}}<br>
A super challenge featuring the familiar faces of enemies from Monthly Event stages, gathered together for one tough map! Get a chance to earn up to {{Color|#FF0000|'''30,000,000 XP'''}} by clearing the stage!

Topple these seasonal baddies and earn mountains of XP to power up your Cat Army!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> After clearing a stage in a Gauntlet map, there will be a cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage in the series.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Spending a Catamin A during this cooldown period will allow you to immediately challenge the next stage.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・"Arena of Power" at the Catclaw Dojo!'''}}<br>
The true test of your Cat Army's abilities awaits you in the newest Catclaw Dojo stage, available for a limited time only!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from October 5th (11:00 AM) until October 29th (10:59 AM)!'''}}

Visit the Catclaw Dojo during this event and choose the Arena of Power stage to see what your Cats are really made of!<br>
All that stands between you and glory is a mere wooden dummy... right?!<br>
Aim for a high score by selecting the perfect Cat Army lineup to face this unmoving dojo sentinel!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Rewards will be unobtainable 1 month after they have been delivered.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Collect a bunch of XP for your Cat Army in limited-time XP stages!<br>
