{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Legend Stages/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings'''}}{{Color|#4285F4|''','''}} and {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Island of Ash!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Check the Event Calendar for event availability.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Catseye Cave and XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Catseye rewards!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Harvest (4 areas)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 11th (11:00am) until May 21st (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Catseye Cave'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 21st (11:00am) until June 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Catseye Limited Capsules & Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 11th (11:00am) until May 21st (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 21st (11:00am) until June 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Catseye Item Capsules drop Catseyes and XP.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Catfruit Item Capsules drop Catfruit, XP, and other items.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Catseye Item Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules after reaching User Rank 1600.<br>
